Lumen Emu - PS4/PS5 emulator port optimised for Android, iOS and Mac (Apple Silicon)
License and provenance notice, updated 2026-10-22

Lumen builds on shadPS4, Kyty and KytyPS5. GS-Soft supplies the Android
integration and platform optimisations. Original authors and contributors
retain their copyright; Lumen is an independent derivative, not an official
release of or a project endorsed by these upstream teams.
Mac (Apple Silicon) and iOS versions are coming soon; the platform scope is
not a declaration of public availability or equal compatibility.

